From 3c0f4b7fe31221523a13e41e3e2beab33f5ed04f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philip Withnall <pwithnall@gnome.org>
Date: Fri, 9 Feb 2024 10:05:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] gthreadedresolver: Move private testing symbols to a
 private header
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The symbols still have to be exported from the library (since they’re
called from unit tests), but there was never any reason for them to be
in a public header.

This means they now disappear from `Gio-2.0.gir`.

Signed-off-by: Philip Withnall <pwithnall@gnome.org>

